<title>USA: Princeton Dental votes reverse split.</title>
<headline>Princeton Dental votes reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEVIEW, Ill. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Princeton Dental Management Corp said Monday its board of directors approved a five-for-one reverse stock split payable today.  </p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available to provide more information.</p>
<p>Shares of Princeton Dental, which manages dental practices, were trading up 7/64 at 29/64.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
